    "source_book_raw": "Blood of the Beast pg. 29",
    "definition_raw": "Source Blood of the Beast pg. 29\nThe act of meditation allows you to steel your mind against mental attacks.\n\nPrerequisites: Wis 19, Meditation Master, Mindful Meditation, character level 13th.\n\nBenefit: For 24 hours after you meditate, whenever you fail your saving throw against a charm, compulsion, emotion, or fear effect, you can attempt a new saving throw again 1 round later at the same DC. You get only this one extra chance to succeed at your saving throw.",
